name: sim.getPluginInfo
description: Returns auxiliary information about a loaded plugin
luaSynopsis: string/int info = sim.getPluginInfo(string pluginName, int infoType)
pythonSynopsis: string/int info = sim.getPluginInfo(string pluginName, int infoType)
inputs:
1. pluginName: name of the plugin. See sim.getPluginName.
2. infoType: type of information to retrieve
outputs:
1. info: the retrieved information
